---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="AHR Expo | Smokeless Heat Blog" description="Varmebaronen / SmokeLess Heat LLC were vendors at the 2015 AHR Expo.">
  <Header />

  <main class="pt-24">
    <section class="py-16 bg-charcoal text-cream">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
        <p class="text-ember text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] mb-4">Events</p>
        <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl">AHR Expo</h1>
      </div>
    </section>

    <article class="py-16 bg-cream">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 space-y-6 text-charcoal/90 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          Varmebaronen / SmokeLess Heat LLC were vendors at the 2015 AHR Expo.
        </p>

        <p>
          The 2015 AHR Expo was a show for the HVAC industry which attracted 62,000 attendees this year. Our 10×10 sq. ft. space was just a small part of the 11 acres of vendor floor.
        </p>

        <p>
          We certainly didn’t see all those visitors past our vendor space, but we had many visitors that took time to see our products.
        </p>

        <img src="https://smokelessheat.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/03/ahr_booth-1024x768-1.jpg" alt="AHR Expo booth" class="w-full border border-wood/20" />

        <img src="https://smokelessheat.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/03/ahr_move_in-1024x768-1.jpg" alt="Moving equipment in" class="w-full border border-wood/20" />

        <p>
          We moved the equipment in by hand. This boiler was 1,000 lb and we needed to unload them from our pickup without lifts or mechanized devices to be able to take advantage of the “self served” setup. Otherwise we would have needed to use expensive riggers to do the move in. We used a dock leveler plate to move them from the back of our truck to the dock. Large wheels were made for the bottom of the boilers to be able to roll them to the show floor.
        </p>

        <img src="https://smokelessheat.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/03/ahr_ramp_at_dock-e1424291761806-576x1024-1.jpg" alt="Dock leveler ramp" class="w-full border border-wood/20" />

        <p class="text-sm text-wood mt-12 pt-6 border-t border-wood/20">
          Originally published: March 2015
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
